ated one after another.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Challenge the boss</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat the powerful enemies waiting at the end of the stage and gain their power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.poster.avif?t=1773837974\" width=780 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.webm?t=1773837974\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/extras/8cd6516127f7fb28493a86cfcee2d152.mp4?t=1773837974\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Buri Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3331090/92b85f0c2ff127bb70973351667bc2267fc5fbc6/header.jpg?t=1773837974","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3331090/1576987927/3073cb9c50699bdbf9fa4f118f2745d0507d789c/1773227811/dash_av1.mpd?t=1773443254","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3331090/1576987927/3073cb9c50699bdbf9fa4f118f2745d0507d789c/1773227811/dash_h264.mpd?t=1773443254","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3331090/1576987927/3073cb9c50699bdbf9fa4f118f2745d0507d789c/1773227811/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1773443254","id":257157868,"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257157868/f6f8709df8f3762671bd85ba8de52635efd74a71/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1773443254"}],"